WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,620 --> 00:00:02,020
thank you thank you

2
00:00:04,840 --> 00:00:07,360
Why are you all gathering around my downstairs? Tell me.

3
00:00:07,520 --> 00:00:09,920
Classmate, you are Lin Mo, right?

4
00:00:10,430 --> 00:00:11,950
She is Lin Mo. Chase quickly.

5
00:00:16,860 --> 00:00:18,540
Classmate Lin Mo, I am wearing your daily newspaper

6
00:00:18,540 --> 00:00:21,140
May I ask how you feel after winning the top prize, Mr. Lin Mo?

7
00:00:21,140 --> 00:00:22,260
I wear it from your mall

8
00:00:22,260 --> 00:00:23,260
I want you to speak for me

9
00:00:23,660 --> 00:00:24,700
You guys look for Lin Mo

10
00:00:24,700 --> 00:00:25,820
What are you doing around me?

11
00:00:25,980 --> 00:00:27,460
When did I say I was Lin Mo?

12
00:00:28,500 --> 00:00:29,740
You are not Lin Mo. Why are you running?

13
00:00:30,060 --> 00:00:31,380
If you chase me, can I not run away?

14
00:00:31,380 --> 00:00:42,980
What about Lin Mo? How do I know Xiao Mo?

15
00:00:43,810 --> 00:00:45,330
You are really the top pick this year

16
00:00:45,920 --> 00:00:47,840
Yes, I am the number one pick this year

17
00:00:48,240 --> 00:00:50,040
Wife champion

18
00:00:50,320 --> 00:00:51,760
Our son is the number one scholar

19
00:00:51,760 --> 00:00:54,080
My son said it himself and there is no lie.

20
00:00:55,010 --> 00:00:57,210
I'm going to buy groceries. Let's celebrate today.

21
00:00:57,210 --> 00:00:59,170
What kind of food should I buy? My son has become the number one scholar.

22
00:00:59,170 --> 00:01:01,050
Go to Daxia Mall for the most expensive meal

23
00:01:01,490 --> 00:01:03,530
The gold membership card thing should have come to an end.

24
00:01:04,010 --> 00:01:06,250
I just don’t know what the outcome will be
